  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tMTD IT\n\t\tMTD IT\n\n### MTD IT - Adding New Clients\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 27 Apr, 2026 at  5:20 PM\n\nThis article explains how to add clients within the MTD IT module in Capium. Please note that the workflow for adding clients has changed. Clients can no longer be imported directly from the Self Assessment module and must now be added from within the MTD IT module itself.\n\n### \nAdding a New Client Directly in MTD IT\n\nIf you need to add a brand new client to the MTD IT module, you can do so directly from within the module.\n\nNavigation > MTD IT > Add Client \n\nAlternatively you can click here :Add Client\n\nClick Add Client.\nEnter the required client details to create the client within the system.\n\nPlease see GIF for reference \n\n### \n\nAdding an Existing Client via Capium 365\n\nIf a client already exists and has been imported into the MyAdmin module, you will need to enable the MTD IT module for them via Capium 365.\n\nNavigation > Capium 365\n\nAlternatively you can click here :Capium 365 Client Portal \n\nFrom the Capium 365 Client Portal, you will see a list of all your clients.\nNavigate to the Individuals client type and select the relevant individual.\nEnsure the following mandatory fields are completed for that individual:UTR Number\nNational Insurance Number\nFull Name\nEmail Address\n\nOnce all mandatory fields have been filled in, go to the Module section.\nEnable the MTD IT module for that individual\n\nPlease see GIF for reference \n\nPlease note: Only individuals can currently be brought into the MTD IT module. Sole traders must first be linked to an individual before they can be added to the module.\n\n### \nLinking Sole Traders to Individuals\n\nIf you have sole trader clients that you need to bring into the MTD IT module, you will need to link the sole trader to an individual first.\n\nFor full guidance on how to do this, please refer to our dedicated article: Linking Sole Traders and Individuals.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118618\">MTD IT</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000201911\">MTD IT</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">MTD IT - Adding New Clients\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 27 Apr, 2026 at  5:20 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<div class=\"fr-draggable\" style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/1e7ce8721e1e42bb92ee3e4706088575\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation allow-popups\"></iframe></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This article explains how to add clients within the MTD IT module in Capium. Please note that the workflow for adding clients has changed. Clients can no longer be imported directly from the Self Assessment module and must now be added from within the MTD IT module itself.</span></span></p><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br><strong>Adding a New Client Directly in MTD IT</strong></span></span></h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">If you need to add a brand new client to the MTD IT module, you can do so directly from within the module.</span></span></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Navigation &gt; MTD IT &gt; Add Client&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Alternatively you can click here :</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://mtdit.capium.com/home/manage/addClient\" dir=\"ltr\"></a><a href=\"%20https%3A//mtdit.capium.com/home/manage/addClient\">Add Client</a></strong></span></span></p><ol class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Click Add Client.</span></span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Enter the required client details to create the client within the system.</span></span></li></ol><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Please see GIF for reference</span> <br></span></span></p><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9247682599/original/h6bl7aH0xtD85cuf-DNN6TpOZ9D4ra8vnA.gif?1777305454\" style=\"width: 420px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9247682599\"><p><br></p><p><br></p><strong>Adding an Existing Client via Capium 365</strong></span></span></h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">If a client already exists and has been imported into the MyAdmin module, you will need to enable the MTD IT module for them via Capium 365.</span></span></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>Navigation &gt; Capium 365</strong></span></span></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Alternatively you can click here<strong dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;:<a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://clientportal.capium.com/manage/clients\"></a><a href=\"https://clientportal.capium.com/manage/clients\">Capium 365 Client Portal&nbsp;</a></strong></span></span></p><ol class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">From the Capium 365 Clie