Geneva,sans-serif;\">Enable the MTD IT module for that individual</span></span></li></ol><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please see GIF for reference <br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9247683379/original/8jGZ3bzGpr4V25VPK56MKxrH0JQbQOLPLQ.gif?1777306143\" style=\"width: 528px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9247683379\"></span></span></p><table style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><tbody><tr><td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width: 100%; background-color: rgb(247, 218, 100); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Please note:</strong> Only individuals can currently be brought into the MTD IT module. Sole traders must first be linked to an individual before they can be added to the module.<br></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br><strong>Linking Sole Traders to Individuals</strong></span></span></h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">If you have sole trader clients that you need to bring into the MTD IT module, you will need to link the sole trader to an individual first.</span></span><br><br></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-